    "id": "fix-repl-eval-prompt-ordering",
    "subject": "Fix TCP REPL prompt appearing before async eval result",
    "status": "pending",
    "description": "In repl-commands.js dispatch(), the else branch calls client.eval().then() but rl.prompt() is called immediately after dispatch() returns synchronously. Prompt appears before result. Move rl.prompt() call into eval .then()/.catch() so it appears after the result.",
    "blocking": [],
    "blockedBy": [],
    "effort": "small",
    "category": "bug",
    "acceptance": [
